        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「千层酥酥」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_8906247800037866203.png",
